*> RUN FROM JCL JOB SHPNIGHT STEP060
*> ********************************************************
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. SHP0006.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-IN-REC.
    COPY SHP0006C.
01 RESULT-AREA.
    *> SHIPMENT BLOCKED Y/N
    05 N-SH               PIC X VALUE 'N'.
    05 SG-AMT             PIC 9(4)V99 VALUE ZERO.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-PARA.
    ACCEPT WS-IN-REC
    PERFORM DANGEROUS-GOODS
    DISPLAY "N-SH=" N-SH
    DISPLAY "SG-AMT=" SG-AMT
    STOP RUN.
DANGEROUS-GOODS.
    IF D-GI EQUAL TO 'Y'
        IF S-SP = 'O'
            MOVE 'Y' TO N-SH
        ELSE IF DK-KM GREATER THAN 800
            MOVE 60 TO SG-AMT
        ELSE
            MOVE 25 TO SG-AMT
        END-IF
        END-IF
    END-IF.
